      "text": "For large networks in the asynchronous regime (excluding the Volcano transition case observed with symmetric coupling coefficients, see [30, 31]), this noise behaves as a superposition of independent Gaussian processes due to the central limit theorem. The autocorrelation of the network noise can be written as:",
